@startuml
autonumber

title US204 - Top 5 Utilized Aircraft Models — Simplified Sequence Diagram
actor "Backoffice Operator" as BO
participant ":System" as Sys

BO -> Sys: Requests to view the Top 5 most utilized aircraft models \n(provides the sorting criteria: flight hours or assignments)
Sys --> BO: Displays the Top 5 list with the corresponding utilization data

@enduml